# title: Worst-of call
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 3
# source: Stulz, Options on the Minimum or the Maximum of Two Risky Assets, Journal of Financial Economics, 1982
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on the worst performer of three stocks: it pays only if all three rose, so it is cheap and long correlation.
#
# Notional 1000, strike 100% of each stock's strike-date level.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)
    s2 = spot(2)

2028-01-04
    worst = min(spot(0) / s0, min(spot(1) / s1, spot(2) / s2))
    pays 1000 * max(worst - 1, 0)
